{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.asahi.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "大屏下面有人在跳",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.asahi.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.asahi.first",
    "idolId": "asahi",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好……差不多该走了——",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "——这里……这样？——",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（那孩子，从刚才一直在跳……嗯？可那个舞……！）",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "——好……成了！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你，能稍微打扰一下吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "？　是我吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，刚才那个舞，是屏幕上广告里的吧？你在练？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "不是，只是试着跳了一下。因为看着好像很好玩！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶？也就是说……你刚看到，就照着跳了？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "是的！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……她说得轻轻松松，可这孩子的厉害之处她自己没意识到吗……）",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（说不定……有着不得了的才能。）",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "～♪",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "其实我是做这个的。",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "『制作人』……吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯，我负责制作偶像。你，如果愿意的话，要不要试试当偶像？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "偶像，是做什么的？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "像刚才你模仿的那个女孩子一样跳舞、唱歌。还有——",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——大概就是这些。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "好像很有趣！我，想试试当偶像！",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "这、这样啊！谢谢！今后请多指教！",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "是！我是芹沢あさひ！请多指教！"
      }
    }
  },
